歌と祈りを捧げて感謝を表します。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-zStmEqfwAe6-utz1UFBRWp9Eq1-C_ef\n\n┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈\n\n今回は、2人の冬の私服のデザインをお願いしたいです🙌\n\nファッションの系統等はおまかせいたしますので、お好きなように描いていただけると幸いです✨\n\nご検討の程、よろしくお願いいたします🙇‍♀️\n\n長文失礼しました。", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1879187, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "忍", "screen_name": "756zl", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1698486236178984960/w4RxOKCV.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1388464118940672000/1693783777/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "nc": 16}, {"id": 3116420, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "ma", "screen_name": "ma_zatta", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1722026595479949312/S9l2dr0v.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1682956585671462914/1721146844/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 17}, {"id": 3263354, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ユ３", "screen_name": "shiromachi94", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1774259530576363520/2ZVoCjBG.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1774031676492177408/1711851433/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expir